would be included.

FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1)
-----------------
The OpenCV package (opencv-python-headless 5.0.0.93) carries FFmpeg 8.1.1 as shared
libraries (libavcodec, libavformat, libavutil, libswscale, libswresample). The
Linux build is configured without the GPL options (--enable-shared,
--enable-openssl and --enable-libvpx only). They are used under the GNU Lesser
General Public License, version 2.1, the text of which is in the OpenCV entry of the
third-party license list. The application never reads video. The source of that
FFmpeg version is at https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-8.1.1.tar.gz; the wheel's build recipe is at
https://github.com/opencv/opencv-python (tag 93).

