Model files (Apache-2.0)
-----------------------
The built-in reader and the automatic image preparation run neural network models
published by PaddlePaddle under the Apache License, Version 2.0: PP-OCRv6 small text
detection and recognition, PP-LCNet_x1_0_doc_ori (page orientation) and UVDoc (flattening
of photographed pages), in their ONNX exports on huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle. They are not
bundled: each is downloaded once, only when the user asks for it, at a pinned revision
checked against a SHA-256 sum (see teachers_teammate/domain/local_models.py).

The built-in reader's text-box post-processing and line cropping re-implement the published
algorithms of PaddleOCR (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR). No PaddleOCR
source code is included in this product.

